<p>ghar se jab bahre safar syed-e- aalam nikle<br />
sar jhukaye huwe ba dida-e- purnam nikle<br />
khai sho farzand kamar baandh ke baaham nikle<br />
roke farmaya ke is shehar se ab ham nikle</p>

<p>raat se girya-e- zehra ki sada aati hai<br />
dekhe'n qismat hame kis dasht me le jaati hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ruq kiya sheh ne sooe qabre shahinshaahe anaam<br />
bahre tasleem jhuke muttasile baabe salaam<br />
izn padh kar jo gaye qabr ke nazdeek imaam<br />
arz ki aaya hai aaj aaqri ruqsat ko ghulam</p>

<p>ye makaa'n ham se ab aye shaahe zaman chut'ta hai<br />
aaj hazrat ke nawase se watan chut'ta hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>chain se sab hai gharoun me, mujhe milta nahi chain<br />
saqt aafat me hai ab aapka ye noorul ain<br />
tukde dil hota hai jab roke haram karte hai bain<br />
nanhe bachhou ko bhala leke kidhar jaaye hussain</p>

<p>shaher me chain na jangal me amaa'n milti hai<br />
dekhiye qabr musafir ko kaha'n milti hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ab mere sar ke liye tez huwe hai qanjar<br />
ahl-e- kee'n shar pa kamar bandhe hai ya qair e bashar<br />
aap ne di thi isi roz ki amma ko qabar<br />
waaleda royi thi do roz talak peet ke sar</p>

<p>is nawase ko magar bhool na jaana hazrat<br />
zibha ke waqt madad karne ko aana hazrat<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ye wo din hai ke parinde bhi nahi chodte ghar<br />
mujhko dar pesh hai in rozo'n me aafat ka safar<br />
hai kahi'n qatl ka samaan kahi'n lutjaane ka dar<br />
saath hai bachhou ka aye baad e shahe jinn-o- bashar</p>

<p>tang jeene se hu paas apne bulalo nana<br />
apni turbat me nawase ko chupalo nana<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ye bayaa'n karke jo taaweez se lipte sarwar<br />
yu hili qabr ke tharrayi zaree-e- anwar<br />
aayi turbat se ye aawaz-e- habeeb-e dawar<br />
teri ghurbat ke mai sadqe mere mazloom pisar</p>

<p>koi samjha na meri god ka pala tujhko<br />
haaye aada ne madine se nikala tujhko<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>aye mere gesuo'n wale mere saber shabbir<br />
mere bekas mere mazloom musafir shabbir<br />
na raha koi tera yawar-o- naser shabbir<br />
haaye aye gor-e gharibaa'n ke mujawer shabbir</p>

<p>tu jaha'n jayega pyare wahi chalta hu mai<br />
qaak udata huwa turbat se nikalta hu mai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>kayee din se teri madar ko nahi qabr me chain<br />
aayi thi shab ko mere paas ye karti huwi bain<br />
ghar mera lut'ta hai faryaad rasool us saqalain<br />
subha ko apna watan chodh ke jata hai hussain</p>

<p>kehne aayi hu ke mu qabr se modungi mai<br />
apne bacche ko akela to na chodungi mai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>sunke ye sheh ne kiya aaqri ruqsat ka salaam<br />
nikle rote huwe jab rouza-e- anwar se imaam<br />
sheh se usdam ye kiya roro ke zainab ne kalam<br />
qabr par maa ki mujhe le chalo ya shah -e- anaam</p>

<p>log hamraah hai mahmil me, mai kyu kar ro'u<br />
maa ki turbat se phir ek baar lipat kar ro'u<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>maa ki turbat pa gaye shaah ba chashme qoon baar<br />
utri mahmil se basad aah-o fugha'n zainab-e zaar<br />
doudh kar qabr se lipte jo imaam-e- abraar<br />
haath zehra ki lahad se nikal aaye ek baar</p>

<p>aayi aawaz na ro dil ko qalaq hota hai<br />
qabr hilti hai kaleja mera shaq hota hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>haa bulaao mera abbas-e- dilawar hai kidhar<br />
wo fida hai mere bache pa mai sadqe uspar<br />
shikam-e- ghair se go hai, pa wo mera hai pisar<br />
ye sada sunke baradar ko pukare sarwar</p>

<p>abhi rahwaar ko aage na badhaao bhai<br />
yaad farmati hain amma idhar aao bhai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>aake abbas ne sar rakh diya paa'ene mazaar<br />
aayi zehra ki sada mai teri ghurbat ke nisaaar<br />
apne pyarou ke barabar mai tujhe karti hoon pyar<br />
dhyaan bhai ki hifaazat ka rahe aye dildaar</p>

<p>koi ghurbat me use maar na daale beta<br />
mera shabbir hai ab tere hawale beta<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>